    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαυστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unceasing, never-ending,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				8.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					574
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					36e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1187
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. καὶ ἀθάνατος φορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					417c
				</span></i>
			, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					391b18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be stopped</i> or <i>assuaged, insatiable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνάθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					237.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίη χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eus.Mynd.
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>never ceasing from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					82
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαυτος.</span></div>
